# 11.34 fire12: road scorch drag sheet widened (.2-.28 of a cel, 2-4 uneven hair strands opening toward the dry tail,
# red head pigment x.45, alpha mean .168); graph as fire11. Adds top:<name> stills (11 m up behind the caster) at 5-7.
call SpellLab308 Run build
sleep 3
call Oheangbu.EditorTools.SpellVFX120.Vfx308Build Run build
sleep 3
call SpellLab308 Run play
wait lab
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run reset
?call SwingProbe308 Run on
?call SwingProbe308 Run target:6
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:0.35
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 0.45
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire12_3
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire12_3
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.25
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire12_4
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire12_4
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 0.40
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire12_5
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire12_5
?call SpellLab308 Run top:lab_fire12_5
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 1.0
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire12_6
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire12_6
?call SpellLab308 Run top:lab_fire12_6
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 1.5
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire12_7
?call SpellLab308 Run side:lab_fire12_7
?call SpellLab308 Run top:lab_fire12_7
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 6
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:1
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run report
mem
finally:
?call SpellLab308 Run stop
sleep 6
